{
  "uid": "bank-trazas",
  "title": "Bank USAC · Flujo de trazas",
  "tags": [
    "bank-usac",
    "trazas"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "description": "La Saga completa en una sola traza, con sus compensaciones.",
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "datasource",
          "uid": "grafana"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "bank-prometheus"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "expr": "changes(kube_deployment_metadata_generation{namespace=~\"$environment\"}[2m]) > 0",
        "iconColor": "light-blue",
        "name": "Despliegues",
        "titleFormat": "Despliegue de {{deployment}}",
        "textFormat": "namespace {{namespace}}",
        "step": "2m"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "datasource",
          "uid": "grafana"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "purple",
        "name": "Releases",
        "target": {
          "limit": 100,
          "matchAny": false,
          "tags": [
            "release"
          ],
          "type": "tags"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": {
          "text": "prod",
          "value": "prod"
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "bank-prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(environment)",
        "includeAll": false,
        "label": "Entorno",
        "name": "environment",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(environment)",
          "refId": "env"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "type": "query"
      },
      {
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "label": "correlationId",
        "name": "correlationId",
        "options": [],
        "query": "",
        "type": "textbox"
      },
      {
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "label": "traceId",
        "name": "traceId",
        "options": [],
        "query": "",
        "type": "textbox"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 34,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Cómo seguir una Saga",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Busca por `correlationId` si tienes el flujo de negocio, o por `traceId` si vienes de un log. Los spans de una transferencia son `transfer.requested` → `transfer` → `saga.step <paso>`, y las compensaciones son `saga.compensation ordered` y `saga.compensation completed` — el criterio 2.2 de la rúbrica pide ver justo esas dos en la traza. El contexto cruza RabbitMQ: `publish <exchange>` y `process <cola>` son padre e hijo aunque estén en servicios distintos."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Transferencias recientes (TraceQL)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "bank-tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "description": "Ordena por duración para encontrar la lenta. Al abrir una traza, el salto a sus logs está en cada span.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "bank-tempo"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{name=\"transfer\"} | select(span.bank.transfer.status)",
          "limit": 50,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Compensaciones (TraceQL)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "bank-tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "description": "Una compensación es el sistema devolviendo el dinero. Que aparezcan aquí es la evidencia de que la Saga cierra.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "bank-tempo"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{name=\"saga.compensation completed\"}",
          "limit": 50,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Depósitos interbancarios (TraceQL)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "bank-tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      },
      "description": "El mismo traceId que el banco pareja, porque el traceparent viaja en la petición.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "bank-tempo"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{name=\"payment.interbank state\"}",
          "limit": 50,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
